irements: - `to` cannot be the zero address. - the caller must have a balance of at least `amount`."},"transferFrom(address,address,uint256)":{"details":"See {IERC20-transferFrom}. Emits an {Approval} event indicating the updated allowance. This is not required by the EIP. See the note at the beginning of {ERC20}. NOTE: Does not update the allowance if the current allowance is the maximum `uint256`. Requirements: - `from` and `to` cannot be the zero address. - `from` must have a balance of at least `amount`. - the caller must have allowance for ``from``'s tokens of at least `amount`."},"transferOwnership(address)":{"details":"Starts the ownership transfer of the contract to a new account. Replaces the pending transfer if there is one. Can only be called by the current owner."},"unstake(uint256,uint256)":{"details":"Requires allowIndependence to be enabled by owner","params":{"minAmountOut":"Minimum wrapped tokens value (slippage protection)","sharesToUnstake":"Number of shares to burn"}},"unstakeAndWithdraw(uint256,uint256)":{"details":"Sends tokens to wrapper and initiates withdrawal on behalf of userUser must call completeWithdrawal() on wrapper after epoch increments","params":{"minAmountOut":"Minimum wrapped tokens to receive (slippage protection)","sharesToUnstake":"Number of shares to burn"}}},"title":"SherpaVault","version":1},"userdoc":{"kind":"user","methods":{"accountVaultBalance(address)":{"notice":"Get total vault balance (asset value) for an account"},"addCCIPPool(address)":{"notice":"Add a CCIP pool address that can mint/burn"},"adjustAccountingSupply(int256)":{"notice":"Adjust accounting supply after manual SherpaUSD rebalancing"},"adjustTotalStaked(int256)":{"notice":"Manual rebalancing of SherpaUSD between chains (called by operator after ownerMint/Burn)"},"applyGlobalPrice(uint256,uint256)":{"notice":"SECONDARY CHAIN: Apply global price from primary (called by script)"},"burn(address,uint256)":{"notice":"Burn tokens from address - callable by CCIP 